<title>UK: Dresdner Finance sets NZ$100 mln four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Finance sets NZ$100 mln four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and Toronto</p>
<p>Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE BV</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.50	MATURITY    12.JUN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.395   PAY DATE    12.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  = 1.625   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
